e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mZQ3U3LQGM0Q7kNvwG4fAP3&_nc_oc=AdrkfMsPH5YM1gxKvQYw_Te9GRolHCE8ttLEra2rqLfIVPGj0aznl_lNlmywBaDyyiI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7HcT6qjQvcj-AxGbZCt9GwsePaVlsN7QjViYvvKrgZDg&oe=6A0DCE79"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l7v63UckJgUQ7kNvwHeSaPb&_nc_oc=Adodd69MNE3BHWIkVPY96A84SScrCSAaA5CILc3qxCQ2G5N0d3gkaAZ2_1IsGCfeuIU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4lJMyUUo1C9bkCSmRtkBsHNKcUiDXyJumoLtFBtpCDfQ&oe=6A0DA5D3"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MhLR7_qbso4Q7kNvwHjqi5o&_nc_oc=Adq1gdrcUtWiAZhmOO6XsPXRYT1mt1q8HHkyrL9I3iZIKQ6H5XqurrXjsTrNzfMee-g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5LBLtZeI6dkMThVPS0L_AK6pV5w9tLkaUNqxP-J9JXsQ&oe=6A0DB17B"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WsPPfhDfzmMQ7kNvwEBSDkV&_nc_oc=AdpS66aJWpRpYtXzUIfZSgRkRPa9p9gsAjcn2P19jiETPwarZ-zRTVyG7dmE3FgV7Ks&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af68zGSc45K-5dg4HmW0cgdsId2pTcK8xtRIBJ1FTrm4nA&oe=6A0DB2CA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NpWo-k4QcS4Q7kNvwH1lnfd&_nc_oc=AdriKbZ2ZB0rBqUASVy9jRnnKgz9bwTR2HuvzxdCJwM3WT_ibtMRiVmeTZyJtzuT3ZY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4T3gXBLYgJ2Ex-bK8nfrl1VyKzQXD5tCj_pOzik8saIA&oe=6A0DD43E"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se